The Unix compress utility has a beautiful effect on nethack save files.
The .Z file it produces is usually less than 10% of the size of the
original save file.  Perhaps this should be included in any scripts
used to copy save files, or even in the next release of Nethack (as an
option? - it takes a little time.)

PC compression utilities would presumably be equally beneficial.

Colin.


